# Line-ending policy.
#
# The shell scripts are executed on Linux; a CRLF would break pattern matching in
# bash (the CR becomes part of the last word on every line) and would make the
# generated site list unusable. The repository therefore stores them with LF.
*.sh                text eol=lf
*.bash              text eol=lf
*.conf              text eol=lf
*.conf.example      text eol=lf
*.txt               text eol=lf
*.md                text eol=lf

# The site list is generated at run time and must never be committed.
wp-found.txt        -text
*.log               -text
